	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">&lt;B&gt;Synchronization&lt;/B&gt; Library VIs can be used to route signals between specified source signal and output terminals for the given DAQmx Task. This Library is applicable for TestScale modules like TS-15050, TS-15100, TS-15110, NI TS-15120, TS-15130.</Property>
